# Hop demo additions: native build output and pod/SPM checkouts that are regenerated by the documented
# prerequisite steps, not authored here.
ios/Pods/
ios/build/
ios/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
android/.gradle/
android/app/build/

# Detox writes per-run logs and failure screenshots here on every `detox test`, which is now a thing
# that happens rather than a thing that errors in a hook.
artifacts/

# The repo root ignores *.xcodeproj because apps/apple/HopDemo GENERATES its project with XcodeGen from
# project.yml, so committing one there would be committing a build output. This app has no generator: the
# React Native template ships HopDemo.xcodeproj as the source of truth, hand-maintained, and CocoaPods needs
# it. Without this negation a clean checkout has no iOS project and `pod install` fails with "Could not
# automatically select an Xcode project", which is exactly what happened to the first version of this app.
# The negation names the directory first, because git does not descend into an excluded directory.
!ios/HopDemo.xcodeproj/
!ios/HopDemo.xcodeproj/**
ios/HopDemo.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
ios/HopDemo.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
